cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Election Records Forensics 2026: a reproducible verification kit"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible file-metadata forensics and sourced fact-check of the four
  document archives published at whitehouse.gov/election-integrity (released
  16 July 2026). Findings are anchored to SHA-256 hashes of the official source
  archives so anyone can reproduce them against the exact bytes.
type: dataset
